WEBVTT

00:01:28.724 --> 00:01:30.170
it is nutritious,

00:01:30.194 --> 00:01:32.898
and -- I can vouch for it -- delicious.

00:01:33.584 --> 00:01:35.554
Why is it wrong to eat it?"

00:01:36.768 --> 00:01:38.437
The man fell silent.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.529
I asked,

00:01:40.998 --> 00:01:45.343
"Have you been told that your food is bad,

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.472
that to eat it is backward,

00:01:48.496 --> 00:01:49.984
not civilized?"

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.683
He nodded silently.

00:01:55.069 --> 00:02:01.209
This was one of the many, many times
in my work with indigenous people in India